<title>USA: Ballard Q2 March 31 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Ballard Q2 March 31 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>DRAPER, Utah 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballard Medical Products said net income for the second quarter ended March 31, 1997, was $7.4 million or $0.26 a share compared to $6.4 million or $0.23 a share in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Sales for the quarter were $30,814,000, compared to $25,807,593 for the second quarter of fiscal year 1996.</p>
<p>For the six months, net income was $14,401,000 or $0.49 a share compared to $12,162,285 or $0.42 a share. Sales for the period were $59,274,000, compared to $49,478,137.</p>
</text>
